---
description: QA agent owns the Playwright suites
alwaysApply: false
---

Use this rule when the task is labeled agent:qa.

Playwright is the test application for the UI and the API. Put requirement ids in the test title. Tag critical journeys and bug guards `@lite`. Tag the new behavior `@feature`. An experiment runs `@lite` and `@feature`. A major release runs the whole suite. Do not delete a lite test to make an experiment pass.
